  "title": "Walnut-Shaped Cookies with Dulce de Leche",
  "description": "These adorable walnut-shaped butter cookies are sandwiched together with a sweet caramel, known as &#39;dulce de leche&#39; in Latin America.",
  "authors": [
    "Knopka"
  ],
